7.3.5 Vehicle Wrecking, Junk and Salvage Yards. The following regulations shall apply to all Junk Yards, vehicle wrecking yards and salvage yards:
(a) No vehicle wrecking, junk or salvage yard shall be located closer than 300 feet from any residential zoning district;
(b) All outdoor storage of salvage and wrecking operations shall be conducted entirely within an enclosed fence or wall except driveway areas. Fences or walls shall be not less than eight feet in height and shall be opaque at the street frontage. Storage between such fences or walls and the street or property line is expressly prohibited. Any fence or wall erected for screening purposes shall be properly painted or otherwise maintained in good condition. All fences must be setback at least 50 feet from a public road right-of-way, and at least 25 feet from side and rear property lines;
(c) Wrecking, junk and salvage yards are permitted only in I-2 Zoning Districts as provided for in this Ordinance.

